============
 state.conf
============

-----------------
ddm configuration
-----------------

:Date: Dec 2025
:Version: ddm @DDM_VERSION@
:Manual section: 5
:Manual group: ddm

SYNOPSIS
========

DConfig application ``org.deepin.dde.ddm``, resource ``org.deepin.dde.ddm.state``

DESCRIPTION
===========

DDM keeps its state through the DConfig framework of the Deepin Desktop
Environment, under the application id ``org.deepin.dde.ddm`` and the resource
name ``org.deepin.dde.ddm.state``. The schema is installed as
**@DDM_DCONFIG_STATE_FILE@**.

OPTIONS
=======

`lastSession`
	Name of the session file of the last session selected.
	This session will be preselected when the login screen shows up.
	Default value is empty.

`lastUser`
	Name of last logged-in user. This username will be
	preselected/shown when the login screen shows up.
	Default value is empty.

SEE ALSO
========

**ddm**\(1\)

